  m_text: 'Each Turn: \n1. Either add a token at rank 1, or advance 1 token on your
    grid. \n2. Remove a counter from that token''s Twist. \n3. Submit 2+ tokens and
    2+ placards at once to score crowns. \n\nBetween Turns:\n4. For each Twist with
    0 counters, each player draws 2 placards and follows its instructions. \n5. Add
    the counters back onto those Twists (2 per player). \n6. The first player to
    reach 20+ crowns wins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31e79ddad7b2d41c395ada76a18cbcdd, type: 2}
